WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,880
Now I have taken over the position of eldest brother

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,880
It all depends on the support of the two of you

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,880
Gentlemen, please come back.

4
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,880
I believe that in a dozen years I will be the master of building the island.

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,880
The agreement must be followed

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,880
Join forces with your country to annex surrounding hosts

7
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,880
The second young master wants to cross the river and destroy the bridge

8
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,880
Where is the word?

9
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,880
According to the agreement, I must become the founder before I can mobilize troops.

10
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,880
I haven't done it yet

11
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,880
They really think our special department is easy to bully

12
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,880
Have you forgotten my junior brother's name?

13
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,040
small chopsticks

14
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,200
The man who almost defrauded the Federation into producing artillery

15
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,200
But that was all many years ago

16
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,200
Your Excellency, there is an old saying in your country.

17
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,200
A good man does not mention his bravery in the past

18
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:40,720
You two, we have a good time together

19
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,720
Wait until I haven't yet, if you still remember the promise

20
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,720
Will definitely abide by it

21
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,720
Play a trick with me

22
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,750
The Federation still trembles when my name is mentioned.
